# Video masters and web encodes staged in assets/ before upload to Cloudflare R2.
# Every video on the site is served from https://media.pellegrinotti.com (see
# MEDIA_BASE in index.html and scripts/upload-to-r2.sh), so nothing here is ever
# requested from Vercel — it was 78 MB of dead weight in each deployment.
# Keep the sub-site folders (therug/, zack/, dinos/) out of this: those DO ship
# their own local clips.
assets/*.mp4
assets/*.mov

